    <data key="d0">Appway Multi-Tenant AWS Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2f_NYiPJQt4</data>
    <data key="d2">Architecture showing Appway's tenant isolation, DevOps automation, and web application cluster on AWS.</data>
